# Protocol Lab — Python + FastAPI + React/Vite + PostgreSQL
# Keep dependency lockfiles (uv.lock, package-lock.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, yarn.lock)
# and small deterministic PCAP/PCAPNG fixtures in tests/fixtures/ under version control.

